## Title: ZacUI |cff33ff99Click casting|r
## Notes: ZacUI click casting: spells, macros, target and menu on any mouse button or key over your unit frames. Replaces Clique.
## Author: Zac
## Version: 3.0.3
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\ZacUI\Media\addonIcon
## X-Category: Interface Enhancements
## Dependencies: Zacui
