# Part of ZacUI. Shares ZacUI's namespace (_G.ZacUI, published by
# Core_Boot) and its saved variables (ZacUIDB.clickcast). The
# ClickCastFrames table and ClickCastHeader it provides exist from file
# load, so they are there when the unit frames build at PLAYER_LOGIN.

